/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (The aim of this project is to develop SmartDiet, a user-friendly dashboard that supports personalized dietary planning based on physical activity patterns. The system integrates activity and nutrition datasets to estimate Total Daily Energy Expenditure \(TDEE\) and guide meal exploration aligned with individual calorie needs, helping users make informed lifestyle decisions.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [29]
>>
