52 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (SmartDiet successfully integrates physical activity and nutrition data into a single interactive dashboard. By visualizing energy balance, the system helps users make informed lifestyle decisions. Although not a medical tool, SmartDiet acts as an educational platform that promotes awareness of healthy habits and supports better daily choices.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [36]
>>
endobj
53 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (SmartDiet is an interactive data visualization dashboard that helps users understand how physical activity relates to estimated diet needs. The system integrates activity and nutrition datasets to calculate daily energy requirements based on user inputs such as age, gender, height, weight, and activity level. Through clear visuals and interactive features, SmartDiet supports exploration of calorie estimation, activity insights, and food comparisons for lifestyle awareness.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [37]
>>
endobj
54 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 15 0 R
/E (Most fitness and diet tools provide fragmented information where activity tracking and diet planning are not integrated, making it difficult for users to balance calorie intake and expenditure. Even when users know how many calories they burn, they often receive no clear dietary guidance. Many applications operate independently and fail to combine activity and nutrition data in a meaningful way \(Olyanasab & Annabestani, 2023\). This issue is critical in Malaysia, where obesity and physical inactivity remain high \(Institute for Public Health, 2023\).)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [38]
>>
endobj
